| ! style="background:rgba(189,193,199,0.6);" | Innoruuk tlu malla, jal ultrinnan zhah ukt xunin ||! style="background:rgba(189,193,199,0.6);" |  Innoruuk be praised; all victory is his doing
|-
| Ilharessen zhaunil alurl || Matrons know best
|-
| ! style="background:rgba(189,193,199,0.6);" | L'alurl velve zhal lil velkyn uss ||! style="background:rgba(189,193,199,0.6);" |  The best knife is the unseen one
|-
| Lil waela lueth vaela ragar brorna lueth wund nind, kyorlin elghinn || The foolish and unwary find surprises and among them, waiting death
|-
| ! style="background:rgba(189,193,199,0.6);" | Khaless nau uss mzild taga dosstan ||! style="background:rgba(189,193,199,0.6);" |  Trust no one more than yourself
|-
| Nindyn vel'uss kyorl nind ratha thalra elghinn dal l'alust || Those who watch their backs meet death from the front
|-
